{
  "id": "c1-e09-privacy-and-surveillance",
  "level": "C1",
  "version": 1,
  "topic": "Privacy and surveillance",
  "parts": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "title": "Interview",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p1-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Good morning. First of all, we'd like to know a little about you.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e09-privacy-and-surveillance/p1-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4300
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q1",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, how careful are you about the information you share online?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e09-privacy-and-surveillance/p1-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5300
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q2",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, do you feel safe in the place where you live?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e09-privacy-and-surveillance/p1-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4200
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q3",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, have you ever been worried about your privacy?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e09-privacy-and-surveillance/p1-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4100
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q4",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, what are the advantages of living in a connected world?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e09-privacy-and-surveillance/p1-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5000
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "title": "Long turn",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p2-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "In this part of the test, I'm going to give each of you three pictures. I'd like you to talk about two of them on your own for about a minute, and also to answer a question briefly about your partner's pictures.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e09-privacy-and-surveillance/p2-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e09-a1",
            "c1-e09-a2",
            "c1-e09-a3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate A, your pictures show people dealing with security and information. Choose two of the pictures and say why privacy might be at risk in these situations, and how the people might feel about it.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e09-privacy-and-surveillance/p2-a.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13700
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate B, how comfortable are you with cameras in public places?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e09-privacy-and-surveillance/p2-a-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5100
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e09-b1",
            "c1-e09-b2",
            "c1-e09-b3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate B, your pictures show devices that collect information. Choose two of the pictures and say what the benefits of these devices might be, and what concerns people might have.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e09-privacy-and-surveillance/p2-b.mp3",
          "audioMs": 12600
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate A, would you use a device like this at home?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e09-privacy-and-surveillance/p2-b-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4200
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "title": "Collaborative task",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p3-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like you to talk about something together for about two minutes. Here are some ways in which our personal information may be used, and a question for you to discuss.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e09-privacy-and-surveillance/p3-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 11100
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-discuss",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 120,
          "diagram": "c1-e09-privacy-and-surveillance",
          "text": "Talk to each other about this question: How acceptable is it for personal information to be used in these ways?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e09-privacy-and-surveillance/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 8100
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-decide",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "diagram": "c1-e09-privacy-and-surveillance",
          "text": "Now you have about a minute to decide together. Which use of personal information is the most worrying?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e09-privacy-and-surveillance/p3-decide.mp3",
          "audioMs": 7200
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "title": "Discussion",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p4-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like to ask you some more questions about privacy and surveillance.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e09-privacy-and-surveillance/p4-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5500
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q1",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "To what extent is privacy a right that should never be given up?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e09-privacy-and-surveillance/p4-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4400
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q2",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, do you think people care enough about how companies use their data?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e09-privacy-and-surveillance/p4-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5600
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q3",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, should parents monitor what their children do online?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e09-privacy-and-surveillance/p4-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4800
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q4",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Is it reasonable to give up some privacy in exchange for greater safety?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e09-privacy-and-surveillance/p4-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5300
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q5",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, how can governments make sure technology companies are held accountable?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e09-privacy-and-surveillance/p4-q5.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6300
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q6",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, could our attitude to privacy change completely in the next generation?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e09-privacy-and-surveillance/p4-q6.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6200
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
